# PRD — FRECUENCIA MÁGICA

## Frontend Design System & Prototype

### PART 2 — APPLICATION SCREENS, USER FLOWS & EXPERIENCE

---

# GENERAL OBJECTIVE

Using the Design System defined in Part 1, design the complete application prototype.

Every screen must feel like part of the same ecosystem.

Do not redesign components.

Reuse the Design System.

Maintain visual consistency across the entire product.

The application should feel handcrafted.

Nothing should resemble a generic SaaS dashboard.

