Create calm

---

# PLACEHOLDER SYSTEM

Do NOT use

Stock Images

People Photos

Random Landscapes

Unsplash

Lorem Picsum

Instead

Create elegant placeholder compositions using

Gradient Bands

Layered Shapes

Soft Blocks

Blurred Containers

Aspect Ratio Frames

Every placeholder must look intentional.

---

# ACCESSIBILITY

Every screen must include

Keyboard Navigation

Visible Focus

Semantic Landmarks

Touch Friendly Controls

Screen Reader Support

Reduced Motion Compatibility

High Contrast Compatibility

---

# UX PRINCIPLES

Every interface must answer

What should I do now?

What is the most important action?

Can I leave without confusion?

Can I continue later?

Can I undo this?

Reduce every possible decision.

Never overwhelm.

---

